## Pegin Message

- PeginRequest
- ConfirmInstance: Operator确认PeginPrepare上链后，广播InitGraph
- InitGraph: Verifier收到InitGraph后，生成GC，广播GenCircuits
- GenCircuits: Operator收到GenCircuits后，选取其中一部分，广播CutCircuits
- CutCircuits: Verifer收到CutCircuits后，为其他的GC生成证明，广播SolderingProof
- SolderingProof: Operator收到SolderingProof，验证后存储，等收到到所有的Verifier的SolderingProof(或者超时)后，构造Graph，广播CreateGraph
- CreateGraph
- NonceGeneration
- CommitteePresign
- EndorseGraph
- GraphFinalize
- PeginConfirmNonce
- PeginConfirmPartialSig
- PostReady

## Pegout Message

- KickoffReady
- KickoffSent
- Take1Ready
- Take1Sent
- ChallengeSent
- WatchtowerChallengeInitSent
- WatchtowerChallengeSent
- WatchtowerChallengeTimeout
- OperatorAckTimeout
- OperatorCommitBlockHashReady
- OperatorCommitBlockHashTimeout
- AssertReady: Operator在监控到Watchtower挑战流程结束后，直接构造proof并广播Assert交易
- AssertSent: Verifier在监控到Assert交易上链后，如果验证Operator的Proof有问题，构造并广播ChallengeAssert交易
- ChallengeAssertSent: Operator在监控到ChallengeAssert被广播后，计算msg，并广播WronglyChanllenge交易
- WronglyChallengeTimeout: Verifier如果监控到ChallengeAssert的时间锁到期，就可以广播NoWithdraw交易，完成Disprove
- Take2Ready
- Take2Sent